---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { COMPANY_NAME } from '../lib/config';
---

<Layout>
  <!-- About Me Section -->
  <section id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
    <h1 id="about-heading">About Me</h1>

    <!-- Ionic Grid -->
    <ion-grid>
      <ion-row>
        <!-- Portrait Image -->
        <ion-col size="12" size-lg="5">
          <div class="ion-text-center">
            <img
              src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}assets/images/about/portrait.png`}
              alt={`Portrait of ${COMPANY_NAME}`}
              aria-describedby="image-info"
            >
            <span class="aria-hide" id="image-info">
              Portrait of {COMPANY_NAME}
            </span>
          </div>
        </ion-col>

        <!-- Text Content -->
        <ion-col size="12" size-lg="7">
          <p>
            Hello, my name is {COMPANY_NAME}, as a digital designer and photographer, I have a deep passion for blending creativity with technical skill. I thrive on capturing moments and crafting visual experiences that tell a unique story. Whether through stunning photography or innovative design, I aim to transform ideas into engaging visuals that leave a lasting impact. Every project is an opportunity for me to explore new ways to communicate and connect through the power of design.
          </p>
          <p class="w3-margin-top">
            In my experience working with professionals across various fields—such as healthcare, legal services, education, and more. I’ve had the opportunity to create and edit a diverse range of visual content designed to meet the specific needs of each industry. Whether it's designing marketing materials, enhancing website visuals, or producing high-quality photos for portfolios or promotional campaigns, I understand the importance of creating work that is both professional and engaging. From legal consultants to wellness experts, I collaborate closely with my clients to ensure that their unique expertise and values are clearly communicated through compelling visuals. By focusing on precision, clarity, and a polished aesthetic, I help strengthen their professional image and build trust with their audience.
          </p>
        </ion-col>
      </ion-row>
    </ion-grid>

  </section> <!-- End About Me -->
</Layout>
